Paraneoplastic stiff person syndrome and limbic 
encephalitis with anti-amphiphysin antibodies.
Invasive ductal carcinoma (grade 2), 0.1 cm in 
greatest dimension; ductal carcinoma in situ (grade 
2), adjacent to and beyond the region of invasion; 
4 of 16 lymph nodes positive for metastasis.</seg>
